{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to Catolonizer \u2013 a thrilling online social deduction game for up to 15 players!</strong> Work together or deceive others as you complete tasks, uncover secrets, and decide who you can trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How to Play:</strong> As an Innocent, your goal is to complete tasks and expose the Killers. Earn coins along the way and visit the Merchant to purchase power-ups that will help you survive. If you're a Killer, your mission is to eliminate everyone without getting caught! But be careful \u2013 some players have unique abilities that could turn the tide of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Chaos:</strong> Play with up to 15 players in an intense game of deception and survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Role-Based Abilities:</strong> Enhance your role with power-ups and unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Social Deduction Gameplay:</strong> Discuss, strategize, and vote to determine who can be trusted.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Matches:</strong> Each game is different, depending on the choices you and your friends make.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you outsmart your opponents and lead your team to victory? Join the Catolonizer community and find out!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3181260?t=1753404372","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181260/3d3d2825ec9557aa5d6ef63be3bd047018dc19a9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753404372","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181260/35107efcf381d79d4aaf77bee9ae024e57d48346/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753404372","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181260/35107efcf38